<p>There isn't a single shield SCP? Wow, color me surprised.</p>
<p>There used to be this book series I read as a kid (Charlie Bone I believe) in which a character had the ability to summon the spirits of his African ancestors to protect him. I got a super nostalgia rush reading this, even though I know the two concepts are completely unrelated.</p>
<p>The idea behind the Potomac Briefings is cool, and I got a good chuckle out of the footnote, followed by a &quot; That makes a lot of sense actually&quot;. It's a neat tidbit of world building.</p>

